    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000711/2010007110070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007110080,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "可愛い衣装だったからもう一回着たいなと\r\n思っちゃったと言いますか！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000711/2010007110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007110090,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "あ、あはははは……",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000711/2010007110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……次からは衣装で遊ばないようにな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007110100,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "は、はいっ……！\r\nすみません……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000711/2010007110100"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bgm": "fade_out",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……まぁでも、気持ちはわかるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "029"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "イタズラ心が出ちゃう時ってあるよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007110110,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "！\r\nプロデューサーさんでもそうなんですか……！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000711/2010007110110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そりゃそうだ\r\n──あ、でも",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だからって、今追加でイタズラしようかなとか\r\n考えるのはナシだぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007110120,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000711/2010007110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お菓子の持ち合わせがないんだ\r\nあの二択を聞かれると困る",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007110130,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000711/2010007110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007110140,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "そ、そんなことしませんよ！\r\n私、プロデューサーさんにイタズラなんてできませんし！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000711/2010007110140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうか\r\nそれは助かる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でもそうすると──……\r\nイタズラしないでくれる優しい悪魔に、お礼が必要だよな",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "多分下に戻れば何かあると思うんだ\r\nもてなしは少し待っててくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007110150,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "だ、だから！\r\nトリック・オア・トリートはしませんってば～……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000711/2010007110150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははは",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007110160,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……それだったらむしろ、\r\nトリート・アンド・トリート、みたいな……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000711/2010007110160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん？\r\nイタズラよりとにかくお菓子をってことか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007110170,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "はいっ、そんな感じのイメージです！\r\nトリートするのは私ですけどね！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000711/2010007110170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007110180,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "──ほら！\r\n私は、チョコアイドルなので！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000711/2010007110180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007110190,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "この先も、甘かったり苦かったりなパフォーマンスで\r\nプロデューサーさんを楽しませますよ！",
